OL,3,A'Our wedding present ruined us': Couple
OL,4,Ajoin dozens in car seller dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewlyweds Amber and Nathan Cooper spent
OL,7,Fall their wedding present money on a
OL,8,F#7,000 Citroen C4 to take them on their
OL,9,Fdream honeymoon.
OL,11,FBut as they made their way to Cornwall
OL,12,Fin August 2025, it lost power and began
OL,13,Fto roll backwards leaving them stranded
OL,14,Fon the A30, near the Jamaica Inn in
OL,15,FBodmin Moor, they told the BBC.
OL,17,FWhen they returned it to Trade Centre
OL,18,FUK two weeks later, they discovered it
OL,19,Fneeded a new engine, clutch and
OL,20,Fgearbox.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
